* Inheritance means when we define a class that inherits all the properties of other class called inheritance. 
* Example : New Class created is know as Child class and from which the child class is inherit/created/derived known as Parent class. 
* So child class can Inherit the Properties of it's Parent class called Inheritance.
* The Main advantage of Inheritance is it increase code reusability
"""
class Father():
